        <https://mpai.community/kg/aim/OSD-BME-V1.5/port/Input/OSD-BLO-V1.5/2>,
        <https://mpai.community/kg/aim/OSD-BME-V1.5/port/Input/OSD-BLS-V1.5/1>,
        <https://mpai.community/kg/aim/OSD-BME-V1.5/port/Input/OSD-BLS-V1.5/2>,
