        <https://mpai.community/kg/aim/MMC-TST-V2.5/port/Input/OSD-TXO-V1.5/0>,
        <https://mpai.community/kg/aim/MMC-TST-V2.5/port/Output/OSD-BSO-V1.5/0>,
